BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (mutable state. Concurrent writers therefore serialize or receive a bounded lock error; callers retry the whole) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (transaction with the same business key, never a partial write. Unique constraints provide a second defense) Tj ET
