BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (a command and marks it sending before any external request. A second worker cannot claim that command.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (A crash after reservation intentionally leaves work unresolved rather than assuming that no offer was) Tj ET
