BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (balances by construction. A single posting batch is atomic, amounts are positive integer cents, and each) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (source reference has an immutable payload. Book earned gross billings as a receivable debit and revenue) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (credit; book vendor expense against payables when the obligation is incurred. Customer receipts debit cash) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (and credit receivables. Vendor payments debit payables and credit cash. Contractor delivery and operating) Tj ET
